msgid "The few round brushes and erasers a painter starts with, hard and soft."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:72
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/presets/noise_presets.gd:53
msgid "Every other paint brush Sara ships: drawn tips, noise, pencils, markers and smudges."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:143
msgid "A hard thin line with no smoothing, paler under a light press, for drawing the picture before painting it."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:150
msgid "A soft round at half flow, for laying in colour."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:168
msgid "A hard round more than a third of the canvas's short side across, see-through under a light press and solid at a full one, for covering ground fast."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:184
msgid "Dry Marker"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:187
msgid "A felt marker that runs dry along the stroke and is full again at the next press."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:206
msgid "Grainy Pencil"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:211
msgid "A pencil whose line catches the lit grain of the paper, thinner under a light hand. The paper shows between the grains, so the line reads lighter than the colour picked and takes the tint of the ground."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:223
msgid "Lit Grain"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:239
msgid "Lost Edges"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:242
msgid "A round whose hardness is drawn afresh for every dab, so one stroke has hard, soft and lost edges."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:252
msgid "A pen with a cut edge, every pixel either opaque or clear, swelling with pressure."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:288
msgid "A flat brush that follows the stroke's direction and sweeps round a corner instead of breaking it."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:344
msgid "A soft spray that keeps flowing while the pen rests, thicker under pressure. It paints in a mixing blend mode where a mixing module is installed, so over another colour it mixes as paint does, blue over yellow turning green."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:377
msgid "A pencil with a little tooth and a line that darkens under pressure, the everyday drawing tool."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:404
msgid "A soft flat stick that catches the paper and turns with the stroke, for tone rather than line."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:444
msgid "Chisel Marker"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:447
msgid "A chisel tip held at one angle, so a stroke is thick one way and thin the other, like a calligraphy marker."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:468
msgid "A wide soft brush with very little flow, so colour builds in thin layers a stroke at a time."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:477
#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:500
msgid "Canvas Weave"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:487
msgid "Canvas Brush"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:490
msgid "A flat bristle brush over canvas weave, the weave showing through where the paint is thin."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:521
msgid "Oil Smudge"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:526
msgid "A flat brush that lays a thin veil of the colour picked and drags what is under it along, wet paint into wet paint."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:575
msgid "A soft round that lays no colour of its own and blends what is there into a gradient."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:603
msgid "A hard round that takes paint away, thinner under a light hand. It paints in the Erase mode, so the colour picked plays no part."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:627
msgid "Soft Eraser"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:632
msgid "A soft eraser that fades paint out rather than cutting it. It paints in the Erase mode, so the colour picked plays no part."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:652
msgid "Halftone"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:656
msgid "A field of dots from a printed dot screen, faint at a light press and solid at a full one, for a halftone texture."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:664
msgid "Dot Screen"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:677
msgid "Spatter"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:682
msgid "Round dots thrown along the stroke, each a random size, lightness and tint, for texture and spray. It paints in a mixing blend mode where a mixing module is installed, so over another colour it mixes as paint does, blue over yellow turning green."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:724
msgid "Masked Stipple"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/presets/sa_shipped_presets.gd:729
msgid "A narrow ribbon with square ends, the trail of a small rectangular tip set at thirty degrees, paler under a light press, for crisp hatching."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/tools/gamma_float.gd:42
msgid "GammaFloat(%.2f, %.2f)"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:35
msgid "Colour Dynamics"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:51
msgid "How far each dab turns the picked colour round the colour circle, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:56
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:468
msgid "How far each dab moves the picked colour towards or away from grey, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:62
msgid "How far each dab lightens or darkens the colour, following the sensors. With Random the value also varies within a stroke."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:70
msgid "How far each dab pulls the picked colour towards black, following the sensors. Nothing at the bottom of the range and black at the top."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:78
msgid "How far each dab blends the picked colour towards the background colour, following the sensors. The painting colour at the bottom of the range and the background at the top. Under a Gradient source it is where on the gradient each dab's colour is picked instead."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:119
msgid "Colour source"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:121
msgid "Plain"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:132
msgid "Where a dab's colour comes from before the five options below move it. Plain is the painting colour. Gradient takes it from the Gradient below at the Mix option's value, from its start at 0 to its end at 1, so Mix walks along the gradient rather than blending."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_color_page.gd:153
msgid "This preset's own gradient. Until a stop is edited it runs from the painting colour to the background colour and follows them."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:65
msgid "How the dab's diameter follows the sensors, as a fraction of the Size row above."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:67
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:461
msgid "How the dab's opacity follows the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:68
msgid "How much paint each dab lays down, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:75
msgid "Multiplies the Brush Tip page's Spacing by the sensors, so the dabs sit closer or further apart as they move."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:77
msgid "How soft the tip's edge is, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:85
msgid "How much of the Hardness row each dab keeps, following the sensors. On the random sensor one brush lays a hard edge, a soft one and a lost one in the same stroke."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:89
msgid "How far the tip is turned, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:93
msgid "Whether the tip is turned over, per dab, once the sensors read past halfway."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:94
msgid "How far the tip is squashed from round, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:106
msgid "How far a dab is thrown off the stroke, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:110
msgid "How much of the texture the dab takes, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:111
msgid "How fast the airbrush lays paint down while the pointer is still."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:118
msgid "How much of the Sharpness row each dab takes, following the sensors."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:148
msgid "How the mask's size follows the sensors, as a fraction of the Mask Size row on the Masking Brush page."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_curve_option_pages.gd:154
msgid "How much of the mask the dab keeps, following the sensors. 1 keeps the whole mask, 0 removes it."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_gradient_row.gd:59
msgid "No module brings a gradient editor, so this preset's gradient cannot be edited here."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_masking_page.gd:60
msgid "Mask "
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_masking_page.gd:134
msgid "Multiplies every dab by a second shape. Off leaves the brush painting exactly as it did."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_masking_page.gd:156
msgid "The mask's diameter as a multiple of the dab's, so the mask stays on the dab at every brush size. 1 is a mask exactly the size of the dab it masks."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_masking_page.gd:168
msgid "Mask Spacing"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_masking_page.gd:178
msgid "How far the mask travels between its own dabs, as a share of its size."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:55
msgid "The pattern the dab is textured with, from Sara's patterns or your own."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:64
msgid "How big the tile is drawn, as a multiple of the pattern's own size."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:73
msgid "Invert the texture, so the dab paints in full where it was taken away."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:87
msgid "How the texture takes paint. Multiply thins the whole dab, Subtract lifts paint where the grain sits, Lightness moves the colour's lightness with the texture's, Height paints only where the texture is low, Colour Burn closes the dab over dark grain, Hard Mix Softer gives a flat fill with hard edges, and Linear Height paints whichever of Height and Multiply paints more."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:97
msgid "Randomize per stroke"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:100
msgid "Move the texture by a new random amount each time you press, so two strokes do not share a grain."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:103
msgid "How far the texture may jump along this axis when a stroke starts, in pixels."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:104
msgid "Random X"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:105
msgid "Random Y"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:111
msgid "Lighten or darken the whole texture, so the same grain takes more or less paint away."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:118
msgid "How deep the grain goes. Its light and dark parts move apart about the neutral point."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:122
msgid "Neutral from pattern"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:124
msgid "Turn the contrast about the texture's own average tone, so the grain widens on any pattern."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:128
msgid "Neutral point"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:134
msgid "The texture value the contrast turns about, which stays as it is. Only used with Neutral from pattern off."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:142
msgid "Cutoff low"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:145
msgid "The darkest texture value kept. Darker values follow the Cutoff row."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:149
msgid "Cutoff high"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:152
msgid "The lightest texture value kept. Lighter values follow the Cutoff row."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:156
msgid "Cutoff"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:158
msgid "Clip the dab"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:158
msgid "Clip the texture"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:163
msgid "What happens outside the band between Cutoff low and Cutoff high. Clip the dab paints nothing there, Clip the texture paints as if there were no texture."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_texture_page.gd:244
msgid "Offset of the texture, in pixels."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:19
msgid "Brush Tip"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:22
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:56
#: ui/brush_editor/editor_pages.gd:35
#: ui/settings/sa_settings_window.gd:121
msgid "General"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:51
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:54
#: ui/presets/brush_presets_chooser.gd:243
msgid "Tip"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:53
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:31
#: ui/layout/docker_layout_presets.gd:48
msgid "Default"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:53
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:31
msgid "Soft Curve"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:61
msgid "How the edge fades. Default has a firm edge, Gaussian fades smoothly, Soft Curve follows the Falloff curve, and Image paints with a picture."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:71
msgid "Circle"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:71
#: modules/sara-base-modules/vector/module.gd:77
#: modules/sara-base-modules/vector/sa_vector_place.gd:16
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:77
msgid "The outline the falloff is measured against. A rectangle ignores the Tip setting above."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:96
msgid "Roundness. 100 is a circle, lower values flatten it."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:123
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:112
msgid "The tip's fixed turn. The Rotation page's sensors turn it further from here."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:149
msgid "Scales the edge's fade and the Soft Curve tip's falloff: 0 is a hard edge, 100 changes nothing. Hardness on the bar sets how wide that fade is, and this scales it."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:164
msgid "Falloff"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:173
msgid "The shape the edge falls off along, from full coverage at the centre to nothing at the rim."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:179
msgid "Spikes"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:190
msgid "2 is the plain ellipse. More folds the shape into that many petals."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:197
#: patterns/lit_grain.gmacs:43
msgid "Density"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:209
msgid "The share of the dab's pixels that take paint at all, which is a spatter rather than a fade."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:216
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/module.gd:347
msgid "Randomness"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:228
msgid "How far each pixel that does take paint may fall short of full coverage."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:243
msgid "Smooth the edge of the dab."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:264
msgid "How far the brush travels between dabs, as a share of the tip's size."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:270
msgid "Auto spacing"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:279
msgid "Space the dabs by the square root of the tip's size instead of a share of it, so a very large brush does not paint in visible lumps."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:287
msgid "Auto spacing amount"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:297
msgid "Multiplies the automatic spacing. Only used with Auto spacing."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:325
msgid "Snaps each dab onto the pixel grid and cuts its edge to opaque or clear. At 100 the brush is a pen rather than a brush."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:333
msgid "Edge softness"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:345
msgid "How much of the soft edge Sharpness keeps. Only used when Sharpness is above 0."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:362
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:120
msgid "Tip image"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:373
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:130
msgid "The tip image. Choose from Sara's tips, imported tips or a folder. The filter above shows one folder at a time."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:386
#: modules/sara-noise-brush-engine/tip/tip_row.gd:141
msgid "Load Tip"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:396
msgid "Reads a .png or a .gbr and paints with it. A .gih pipe paints its cells. An .abr lists its tips to pick."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:408
msgid "Lightness Map"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:419
msgid "What the picture does to the colour. Mask lays the brush colour through its shape, Lightness Map moves that colour by the picture's lightness, and Gradient Map paints each part in the colour the Gradient row on the Colour Dynamics page holds at that lightness. A grey picture has mid grey lightness throughout, so it maps to the gradient's middle."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:456
msgid "How far the tip picture's own lightness moves the colour this brush lays: dark areas darken it and light areas lighten it, with the middle of the picture changing nothing. Read off a picture that carries colour, and nothing at all off a grey tip. Only in Lightness Map mode."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:465
msgid "Mirror Tip H"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:472
msgid "H"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:476
msgid "Mirror tip"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:479
msgid "Flips the tip inside its own dab, left for right. Not the same as Mirror H on the top bar, which paints a second image of the whole stroke."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:487
msgid "Mirror Tip V"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:494
msgid "V"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:499
msgid "Flips the tip inside its own dab, top for bottom. Not the same as Mirror V on the top bar, which paints a second image of the whole stroke."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:514
msgid "Cross"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:516
msgid "Build-up"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:523
msgid "What happens where a stroke crosses itself. Build-up darkens there, Wash reaches the opacity it was set to and stops. Erasing and an alpha-locked layer always build up."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:538
msgid "Keeps depositing paint while the pointer is held still, on a clock rather than on travel."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:556
msgid "Dabs per second while the pen is held down. Only used with Airbrush."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:562
msgid "Ignore spacing"
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_page.gd:570
msgid "Place dabs by time only, ignoring how far the pen moves. Only used with Airbrush."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stamp-brush/ui/sa_tip_preview.gd:71
msgid "The tip this brush stamps, as one dab at full pressure."
msgstr ""

#: modules/sara-base-modules/stats/coverage_and_edges.gd:55
